{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-EXERCISE-256YE","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-HINT-256YE-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 256Ye","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-SEG-256YE","semantic_anchor":"256Ye","source_anchor":"256Ye","source_line_start":903,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"6249552be9f9db9ee68dcb02cbc8550df48fce7645c2402ac806d6e8cec0c20b","source_text":"find a sequence $\\sequencen{\\alpha_n}$ of\nstrictly positive numbers such that $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\alpha_n\\nu_n\nB(\\tbf{0},k)<\\infty$ for every $k$, and set\n$\\nu=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\alpha_n\\nu_n$, using the idea of 256Xe.","target_line_start":915,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"0d76021660ef7b67865b27d811f1feecc3755f4b149ee9ce033344b22f780d8f","target_text":"carilah barisan $\\sequencen{\\alpha_n}$ dari\nbilangan-bilangan positif ketat sedemikian sehingga\n$\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\alpha_n\\nu_n\nB(\\tbf{0},k)<\\infty$ untuk setiap $k$, dan tetapkan\n$\\nu=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\alpha_n\\nu_n$, dengan menggunakan gagasan 256Xe.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-EXERCISE-256YF","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-HINT-256YF-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 256Yf","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-SEG-256YF","semantic_anchor":"256Yf","source_anchor":"256Yf","source_line_start":931,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"e8469bf28a04187720fa8e74b6c99b7f1925ce2442304eaa66bd8bf6a9b48a34","source_text":"look at sets of the form\n$\\{x:q_i\\le x(i)\\le q'_i\\Forall i\\le n\\}$, where $q_i$, $q'_i\\in\\Bbb Q$ for $i\\le n$.","target_line_start":946,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"98e6959f1badffdf966b6d66ce30fa1c1eb3072f9383a8c4d0b271f3b662ce25","target_text":"perhatikan himpunan-himpunan\nberbentuk\n$\\{x:q_i\\le x(i)\\le q'_i\\Forall i\\le n\\}$, dengan $q_i$, $q'_i\\in\\Bbb Q$\nuntuk $i\\le n$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-EXERCISE-256YF","hint_ordinal":2,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-HINT-256YF-02","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 256Yf","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256-SEG-256YF","semantic_anchor":"256Yf","source_anchor":"256Yf","source_line_start":935,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"ffecbeab0165cade8465c314ddc569c30af8f654e81648b33d1c620c50cfed08","source_text":"show that there are compact sets of measure\narbitrarily\nclose to $1$, and therefore that every open set, and every closed set,\nincludes a K$_{\\sigma}$ set of the same measure.","target_line_start":952,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"1ffce81e31df3be87e239515b83e4423041e7b4d07ff0948736c3befcc37a85a","target_text":"tunjukkan bahwa terdapat himpunan-himpunan\nkompak yang ukurannya sedekat yang diinginkan dengan $1$, dan karena itu setiap\nhimpunan terbuka, dan setiap himpunan tertutup, memuat suatu himpunan\nK$_{\\sigma}$ dengan ukuran yang sama.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S256"}
